(text "J1: USB 2.0 device. 5.1k on each CC pin asks the host for 5 V.\nJ4 carries only the two PWM signals to the separate LED driver board, which has its own 5 to 12 V supply\n(AL8860 needs at least 4.5 V; do not power it from this board). 100k pull-downs hold the signals low during reset.\nJ2: standard 10-pin 1.27 mm Cortex debug header." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e4c13af1-f1c3-5411-9d89-fb72c649cb9d"))
